      ":question/problem": "![](images/88/88284c4c0d2464684d683910be955c84c79d42a3af9ebd032c72368fe5692b4f.png)\n\nThe string $11$ is written on the tape of the Turing machine given by the transition table below, where $\u25fb$ is the blank symbol. The tape head initially observes the left-most symbol of the string in state $q_{1}$. From left to right, what are the missing parts of the tree of moves shown above for the given machine?\n\n| $_{Q}\u2216^{\u0393}$ | $1$ | $\u25fb$ |\n| --- | ---: | ---: |\n| $\u2192 q_{1}$ | $(q_{1}, 1, R), (q_{2}, \u25fb, R)$ | $-$ |\n| $q_{2}$ | $(q_{2}, 1, L)$ | $(q_{0}, 1, R)$ |\n| $\u2217q_{0}$ | $-$ | $-$ |"
