      ":question/problem": "![](images/4a/4aebd3cf5ba521fe53b529a5962bcd4cb8b3c384b44286ded069a25cba33776a.png)\n\nThe string $\u25fb1$ is written on the tape of the Turing machine given by the transition table below, where $\u25fb$ is the blank symbol. The tape head initially observes the left-most symbol of the string in state $q_{1}$. What is the missing part of the tree of moves shown above for the given machine?\n\n| $_{Q}\u2216^{\u0393}$ | $\u25fb$ | $1$ |\n| --- | ---: | ---: |\n| $\u2192 q_{1}$ | $(q_{1}, \u25fb, R), (q_{2}, 1, L)$ | $(q_{0}, 1, L)$ |\n| $q_{2}$ | $(q_{0}, 1, R)$ | $-$ |\n| $\u2217q_{0}$ | $-$ | $-$ |"
